{
  "$defs": {
    "CameraParams": {
      "description": "Serializable camera parameters for building a runtime model.",
      "properties": {
        "distortion": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/DistortionParams",
          "description": "Distortion model parameters."
        },
        "intrinsics": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/FxFyCxCy",
          "description": "Pinhole intrinsics (`fx, fy, cx, cy` in pixels)."
        },
        "projection": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/ProjectionParams",
          "description": "Projection model parameters."
        },
        "sensor": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/SensorParams",
          "description": "Sensor model parameters."
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "projection",
        "distortion",
        "sensor",
        "intrinsics"
      ],
      "type": "object"
    },
    "CorrespondenceView": {
      "description": "A single view containing 2D-3D point correspondences.\n\nThis is the canonical observation type used across planar intrinsics,\nrig extrinsics, hand-eye calibration, and other calibration problems.\n\n# Fields\n\n- `points_3d`: 3D points in world/target coordinates\n- `points_2d`: Corresponding 2D pixel observations\n- `cov_px`: optionally, the covariance of each image point\n  ([`PointCovariance`], px²)\n\nWithin one calibration input either every view carries covariances or\nnone does.\n\n# Example\n\n```\nuse vision_calibration_core::{CorrespondenceView, PointCovariance, Pt2, Pt3};\n\nlet points_3d = vec![Pt3::new(0.0, 0.0, 0.0), Pt3::new(0.1, 0.0, 0.0)];\nlet points_2d = vec![Pt2::new(320.0, 240.0), Pt2::new(400.0, 240.0)];\nlet view = CorrespondenceView::new(points_3d.clone(), points_2d.clone()).unwrap();\nassert_eq!(view.len(), 2);\nassert!(view.covariances().is_none());\n\n// With a stated covariance per point.\nlet cov = PointCovariance::new(0.04, 0.0, 0.04).unwrap();\nlet view =\n    CorrespondenceView::new_with_covariances(points_3d, points_2d, vec![cov; 2]).unwrap();\nassert_eq!(view.covariance(1), Some(cov));\n```",
      "properties": {
        "cov_px": {
          "default": [],
          "description": "The covariance of each image point, px², one per point; absent or\nempty when not stated. Within one calibration input either every\nview states them or none does.",
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/PointCovariance"
          },
          "type": "array"
        },
        "points_2d": {
          "description": "The matching image points `[u, v]`, pixels.",
          "items": {
            "items": {
              "format": "double",
              "type": "number"
            },
            "maxItems": 2,
            "minItems": 2,
            "type": "array"
          },
          "type": "array"
        },
        "points_3d": {
          "description": "3D points `[x, y, z]` in the target frame, metres.",
          "items": {
            "items": {
              "format": "double",
              "type": "number"
            },
            "maxItems": 3,
            "minItems": 3,
            "type": "array"
          },
          "type": "array"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "points_3d",
        "points_2d"
      ],
      "type": "object"
    },
    "DistortionParams": {
      "description": "Serializable distortion model parameters.",
      "oneOf": [
        {
          "description": "No distortion.",
          "properties": {
            "type": {
              "const": "none",
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "type"
          ],
          "type": "object"
        },
        {
          "description": "Brown-Conrady 5-parameter radial-tangential model.",
          "properties": {
            "iters": {
              "description": "Maximum Newton iterations of [`DistortionModel::undistort`] (0 → 20).",
              "format": "uint32",
              "minimum": 0,
              "type": "integer"
            },
            "k1": {
              "description": "Radial coefficient k1.",
              "format": "double",
              "type": "number"
            },
            "k2": {
              "description": "Radial coefficient k2.",
              "format": "double",
              "type": "number"
            },
            "k3": {
              "description": "Radial coefficient k3.",
              "format": "double",
              "type": "number"
            },
            "p1": {
              "description": "Tangential coefficient p1.",
              "format": "double",
              "type": "number"
            },
            "p2": {
              "description": "Tangential coefficient p2.",
              "format": "double",
              "type": "number"
            },
            "type": {
              "const": "brown_conrady5",
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "type",
            "k1",
            "k2",
            "k3",
            "p1",
            "p2",
            "iters"
          ],
          "type": "object"
        },
        {
          "description": "OpenCV rational polynomial 8-parameter model.",
          "properties": {
            "iters": {
              "description": "Maximum Newton iterations of [`DistortionModel::undistort`] (0 → 20).",
              "format": "uint32",
              "minimum": 0,
              "type": "integer"
            },
            "k1": {
              "description": "Numerator radial coefficient k1.",
              "format": "double",
              "type": "number"
            },
            "k2": {
              "description": "Numerator radial coefficient k2.",
              "format": "double",
              "type": "number"
            },
            "k3": {
              "description": "Numerator radial coefficient k3.",
              "format": "double",
              "type": "number"
            },
            "k4": {
              "description": "Denominator radial coefficient k4.",
              "format": "double",
              "type": "number"
            },
            "k5": {
              "description": "Denominator radial coefficient k5.",
              "format": "double",
              "type": "number"
            },
            "k6": {
              "description": "Denominator radial coefficient k6.",
              "format": "double",
              "type": "number"
            },
            "p1": {
              "description": "Tangential coefficient p1.",
              "format": "double",
              "type": "number"
            },
            "p2": {
              "description": "Tangential coefficient p2.",
              "format": "double",
              "type": "number"
            },
            "type": {
              "const": "rational",
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "type",
            "k1",
            "k2",
            "k3",
            "k4",
            "k5",
            "k6",
            "p1",
            "p2",
            "iters"
          ],
          "type": "object"
        },
        {
          "description": "Brown-Conrady + thin-prism 9-parameter model.",
          "properties": {
            "iters": {
              "description": "Maximum Newton iterations of [`DistortionModel::undistort`] (0 → 20).",
              "format": "uint32",
              "minimum": 0,
              "type": "integer"
            },
            "k1": {
              "description": "Radial coefficient k1.",
              "format": "double",
              "type": "number"
            },
            "k2": {
              "description": "Radial coefficient k2.",
              "format": "double",
              "type": "number"
            },
            "k3": {
              "description": "Radial coefficient k3.",
              "format": "double",
              "type": "number"
            },
            "p1": {
              "description": "Tangential coefficient p1.",
              "format": "double",
              "type": "number"
            },
            "p2": {
              "description": "Tangential coefficient p2.",
              "format": "double",
              "type": "number"
            },
            "s1": {
              "description": "Thin-prism coefficient s1 (x correction, r²).",
              "format": "double",
              "type": "number"
            },
            "s2": {
              "description": "Thin-prism coefficient s2 (x correction, r⁴).",
              "format": "double",
              "type": "number"
            },
            "s3": {
              "description": "Thin-prism coefficient s3 (y correction, r²).",
              "format": "double",
              "type": "number"
            },
            "s4": {
              "description": "Thin-prism coefficient s4 (y correction, r⁴).",
              "format": "double",
              "type": "number"
            },
            "type": {
              "const": "thin_prism",
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "type",
            "k1",
            "k2",
            "k3",
            "p1",
            "p2",
            "s1",
            "s2",
            "s3",
            "s4",
            "iters"
          ],
          "type": "object"
        },
        {
          "description": "Fitzgibbon single-parameter division model.",
          "properties": {
            "lambda": {
              "description": "Division distortion coefficient.",
              "format": "double",
              "type": "number"
            },
            "type": {
              "const": "division",
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "type",
            "lambda"
          ],
          "type": "object"
        },
        {
          "description": "Kannala-Brandt 4-parameter radial polynomial.",
          "properties": {
            "iters": {
              "description": "Maximum Newton iterations of [`DistortionModel::undistort`] (0 → 20).",
              "format": "uint32",
              "minimum": 0,
              "type": "integer"
            },
            "k1": {
              "description": "Coefficient of `r²`.",
              "format": "double",
              "type": "number"
            },
            "k2": {
              "description": "Coefficient of `r⁴`.",
              "format": "double",
              "type": "number"
            },
            "k3": {
              "description": "Coefficient of `r⁶`.",
              "format": "double",
              "type": "number"
            },
            "k4": {
              "description": "Coefficient of `r⁸`.",
              "format": "double",
              "type": "number"
            },
            "type": {
              "const": "kannala_brandt4",
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "type",
            "k1",
            "k2",
            "k3",
            "k4",
            "iters"
